#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_encryption.rst:15
msgid "What has been changed"
msgstr "변경된 사항"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_encryption.rst:17
msgid ""
"The support for ``MCrypt`` has been dropped, as that has been deprecated "
"as of PHP 7.2."
msgstr ""
"PHP 7.2부터 deprecated된 ``MCrypt``\ 에 대한 지원이 중단되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_encryption.rst:20
msgid "Upgrade Guide"
msgstr "업그레이드 가이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_encryption.rst:22
msgid ""
"Within your configs the ``$config['encryption_key'] = 'abc123';`` moved "
"from **application/config/config.php** to ``public $key = 'abc123';`` in "
"**app/Config/Encryption.php**."
msgstr ""
"설정에서 ``$config['encryption_key'] = 'abc123';``\ 이 "
"**application/config/config.php**\ 에서 **app/Config/Encryption.php**\ 의 "
"``public $key = 'abc123';``\ 으로 이동되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_encryption.rst:23
msgid ""
"If you need to decrypt data encrypted with CI3's Encryption, configure "
"settings to maintain compatibility. See :ref:`encryption-compatible-with-"
"ci3`."
msgstr ""
"CI3의 암호화로 암호화된 데이터를 복호화해야 하는 경우, 호환성을 유지하도록 설정을 구성하십시오. "
":ref:`encryption-compatible-with-ci3`\ 를 참조하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_encryption.rst:24
msgid ""
"Wherever you have used the encryption library you have to replace "
"``$this->load->library('encryption');`` with ``$encrypter = "
"service('encrypter');`` and change the methods for encryption and "
"decrypting like in the following code example."
msgstr ""
"암호화 라이브러리를 사용한 모든 곳에서 ``$this->load->library('encryption');``\ 을 "
"``$encrypter = service('encrypter');``\ 로 교체하고, 다음 코드 예제와 같이 "
"암호화 및 복호화 메서드를 변경해야 합니다."

